  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Development in Statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetsutveckling av Statistikmyndigheten</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka den Guatemalas statistikmyndighets (INE) kapacitet att genomf&#xf6;ra stitt uppdrag och d&#xe4;rmed f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra tillg&#xe5;ngen p&#xe5; statistik i landet. Det handlar om att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliteten i den statistik som INE sj&#xe4;lv producerar, s&#xe4;rkilt inom omr&#xe5;dena ekonomi, milj&#xf6; och j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet. Det handlar ocks&#xe5; om att st&#xe4;rka myndighetens f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att samordna Gutamalas nationella statistiksystem och bidra till kvalitetss&#xe4;kring av statistik som levereras av andra myndigheter. Projektet f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bidra till &#xf6;kad transparens i samh&#xe4;llet och till att f&#xf6;retag, politiker och privatpersoner har b&#xe4;ttre underlag f&#xf6;r sina beslut. Insatsen genomf&#xf6;rs av Statistiska Centralbyr&#xe5;n, som i sin tur ger st&#xf6;d till INE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the intervention is to strengthen the capacity of Guatemala&apos;s national statistics agency to: (i) coordinate and lead the national statistics system; and (ii) produce high quality statistics. The project is expected to contribute better economic, environmental and gender statistics, incrementing the trust in statistics as a basis for decision making among actors in society. The project will be implemented by Statistic Sweden, which will provide technical and capacity development support to its Guatemalan counterpart.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective pursued through the implementation of the proposed cooperation project is that Guatemala counts on statistical data that are reliable, impartial and of good quality for the decision making by the government, the state and private sector as well as for civil society, including for research and debate.
The project will more specifically support the strategic orientations regarding the following priority areas: this includes strengthening INE&#x2019;s ability to coordinate the Guatemalan statistical system, strengthening INE&#x2019;s capacity in coordinating users and producers of statistics (Oficinas Sectorales de Estadistica, OSCE).
Furthermore, the project aims to increase the credibility of the statistics produced and to increase the dissemination of statistical data.</narrative>
  </description>
